<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1472252408"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1799933925"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Beautiful Birthday"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RAISE A SUILEN"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ERA"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:03.141"><div begin="00:06.488" end="04:03.521"><p begin="00:06.488" end="00:11.851" itunes:key="L26071">"Beautiful Birthday"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“Beautiful Birthday”</span></p><p begin="00:09.241" end="00:11.821" itunes:key="L26072">(Iʼm glad I met you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(I'm glad I met you)</span></p><p begin="00:23.660" end="00:28.978" itunes:key="L26073">冷えた夢に 突き刺さった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刺向冰冷梦想的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi e ta yu me ni tsu ki sa sa 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:29.088" end="00:34.663" itunes:key="L26074">Ah-ah 光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah ah hi ka ri</span></p><p begin="00:33.359" end="00:35.068" itunes:key="L26075">(I need you right now)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(I need you right now)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i ma ma bo ku no su be te</span></p><p begin="00:34.678" end="00:40.038" itunes:key="L26076">眩しいまま 僕のすべて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此耀眼 将我的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i ma ma bo ku no su be te</span></p><p begin="00:40.048" end="00:46.044" itunes:key="L26077">Ah-ah 抱きしめた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧怀抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah ah da ki shi me ta</span></p><p begin="00:45.612" end="00:48.259" itunes:key="L26078">(Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵是地狱我也无所畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji go ku da 't te ka ma wa na i</span></p><p begin="00:46.095" end="00:48.800" itunes:key="L26079">地獄だって構わない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是地狱也无所谓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji go ku da 't te ka ma wa na i</span></p><p begin="00:48.293" end="00:51.622" itunes:key="L30301">(Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能在你的身边生活</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no mo to de i ki re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="00:48.832" end="00:51.627" itunes:key="L26080">あなたの元で生きれるなら<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no mo to de i ki re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="00:51.237" end="00:57.100" itunes:key="L26081">その度 感じたのは (Ah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是神明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ta bi ka n ji ta no wa ah</span></p><p begin="00:57.110" end="01:05.405" itunes:key="L26082">カミサマなんて 要らないくらいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也比不上我感受到的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma na n te i ra na i ku ra i no</span></p><p begin="01:02.691" end="01:06.783" itunes:key="L26083">完璧な (Beautiful World)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这完美的beautiful world</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n pe ki na beautiful world</span></p><p begin="01:06.793" end="01:13.152" itunes:key="L26084">世界は (Donʼt let go) あなたを待ってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wa</span></p><p begin="01:12.401" end="01:15.509" itunes:key="L26085">小さくも大きく 輝く姿は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">娇小却又高大 你光辉的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa ku mo o o ki ku ka ga ya ku su ga ta wa</span></p><p begin="01:15.519" end="01:18.373" itunes:key="L26086">過去すら染め上げて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮了我们每个人的曾经</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ko su ra so me a ge te</span></p><p begin="01:18.383" end="01:24.019" itunes:key="L26087">もう (Donʼt let go) そこに影はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u</span></p><p begin="01:23.543" end="01:29.986" itunes:key="L26088">叫ぶ 感謝と Bless your Birthday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐喊的是对你的感谢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ke bu ka n sha to</span></p><p begin="01:40.515" end="01:45.896" itunes:key="L26089">理解されずに なじられても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算不被理解 就算遭受责难</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri ka i sa re zu ni na ji ra re te mo</span></p><p begin="01:45.906" end="01:50.487" itunes:key="L26090">Ah-ah 進もう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要继续向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah ah su su mo u</span></p><p begin="01:50.197" end="01:51.775" itunes:key="L26091">(Donʼt wanna lose you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(Don't wanna lose you)</span></p><p begin="01:51.526" end="01:56.814" itunes:key="L26092">あなたがいる居場所がある<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要还拥有和你相伴的容身之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga i ru i ba sho ga a ru</span></p><p begin="01:56.824" end="02:02.666" itunes:key="L26093">Ah-ah それだけで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅此便已足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Ah ah so re da ke de</span></p><p begin="02:02.292" end="02:05.021" itunes:key="L26094">(Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深深地颤动不止的左右脑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru wa se ta u no u sa no u</span></p><p begin="02:02.836" end="02:05.541" itunes:key="L26095">震わせた右脳左脳<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤动的右脑左脑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru wa se ta u no u sa no u</span></p><p begin="02:05.030" end="02:08.146" itunes:key="L31694">(Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受到灼伤般的强烈冲击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ke do su ru yo u na sho u ge ki de</span></p><p begin="02:05.645" end="02:08.229" itunes:key="L26096">ヤケドするような衝撃で<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ke do su ru yo u na sho u ge ki de</span></p><p begin="02:08.239" end="02:13.859" itunes:key="L26097">与えられたリリック(Ah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你赠与我的歌词</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta e ra re ta ri ri 'k ku ah</span></p><p begin="02:13.969" end="02:22.115" itunes:key="L26098">欠けたココロを いとも簡単に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻易地便填补了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke ta ko ko ro wo i to mo ka n ta n ni</span></p><p begin="02:19.489" end="02:23.516" itunes:key="L26099">埋めていった (Beautiful World)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我内心的空虚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u me te i 't ta beautiful world</span></p><p begin="02:23.526" end="02:30.149" itunes:key="L26100">世界は (Donʼt let go) あなたと在るんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wa</span></p><p begin="02:29.258" end="02:32.346" itunes:key="L26101">強気な笑顔と 揺らがない瞳<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">顽强的笑容 坚定的眼神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ki na e ga o to yu ra ga na i hi to mi</span></p><p begin="02:32.356" end="02:35.133" itunes:key="L26102">かけがえのない思い出<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那不可取代的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke ga e no na i o mo i de</span></p><p begin="02:35.243" end="02:41.254" itunes:key="L26103">もう (Donʼt let go) 二度と離さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u</span></p><p begin="02:40.424" end="02:46.713" itunes:key="L26104">込める 愛しさ Bless your Birthday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">饱含无尽的爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko me ru i to shi sa</span></p><p begin="03:19.664" end="03:22.481" itunes:key="L26105">僕なりに 傍にいたいと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想以我的方式 陪伴在你的身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku na ri ni so ba ni i ta i to</span></p><p begin="03:22.491" end="03:24.943" itunes:key="L26106">あの日そっと誓ったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天 我曾如此暗自发誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi so 't to chi ka 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="03:24.953" end="03:27.665" itunes:key="L26107">R・A・S (We are!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">R·A·S(We are！)</span></p><p begin="03:27.675" end="03:30.487" itunes:key="L26108">R・A・S (We are!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">R·A·S(We are！)</span></p><p begin="03:30.497" end="03:32.821" itunes:key="L26109">「ア イ シ テ ル」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">&quot;我 爱 你&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 a i shi te ru 」</span></p><p begin="03:32.831" end="03:39.028" itunes:key="L26110">この先もずっと…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后也不会改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki mo zu 't to</span></p><p begin="03:36.709" end="03:39.013" itunes:key="L26111">「I love you, too.」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「I love you, too.」</span></p><p begin="03:39.028" end="03:40.361" itunes:key="L26112">(Beautiful World)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(Beautiful World)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a tsu sa ni</span></p><p begin="03:40.371" end="03:46.483" itunes:key="L26113">熱さに (Donʼt let go) 涙が溢れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因心中的这份热情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a tsu sa ni</span></p><p begin="03:45.993" end="03:49.146" itunes:key="L26114">産声へ走 絶景を見たくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝着那昭示重生的哭声奔去 想要见证那无与伦比的绝景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u bu go e he ha shi ru ze 'k ke i wo mi ta ku te</span></p><p begin="03:49.156" end="03:52.073" itunes:key="L26115">抱きしめ返したくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要将你回拥入怀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki shi me ka e shi ta ku te</span></p><p begin="03:52.083" end="03:57.757" itunes:key="L26116">…もう (Donʼt let go) 二度と離さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u</span></p><p begin="03:57.171" end="04:03.521" itunes:key="L26117">込める 愛しさ Bless your Birthday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">饱含无尽的爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko me ru i to shi sa</span></p></div></body></tt>